      "edition": ".NET 5-11 runtime compilation and deployment",
      "items": [
        "Native AOT became a supported deployment option in .NET 7; .NET 8 added ASP.NET Core Native AOT support. Dynamic profile-guided optimization is available beginning with .NET 6. These deployment options change compilation and runtime capabilities while the CLR, IL, and assembly metadata model remains useful for understanding ordinary managed applications."
